WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.536
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Sarah. Welcome to Online A one, Book three.

2
00:00:05.836 --> 00:00:08.758
Hi! I'm Rithy. Let's learn together!

3
00:00:09.058 --> 00:00:15.530
Unit four: Days of the Week. In this unit, you will talk about what you do on different days.

4
00:00:16.517 --> 00:00:17.402
Monday.

5
00:00:18.102 --> 00:00:20.751
Monday means the first school day of the week.

6
00:00:21.051 --> 00:00:22.656
I have English on Monday.

7
00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:26.334
Your turn. Say: Monday.

8
00:00:29.034 --> 00:00:29.814
Monday.

9
00:00:30.817 --> 00:00:31.795
Tuesday.

10
00:00:32.495 --> 00:00:34.633
Tuesday means the day after Monday.

11
00:00:34.933 --> 00:00:36.898
We play football on Tuesday.

12
00:00:37.598 --> 00:00:39.925
Your turn. Say: Tuesday.

13
00:00:42.625 --> 00:00:43.429
Tuesday.

14
00:00:44.417 --> 00:00:45.453
Wednesday.

15
00:00:46.153 --> 00:00:48.767
Wednesday means the day in the middle of the week.

16
00:00:49.067 --> 00:00:50.707
I have art on Wednesday.

17
00:00:51.407 --> 00:00:54.489
Your turn. Say: Wednesday.

18
00:00:57.189 --> 00:00:58.097
Wednesday.

19
00:00:59.083 --> 00:01:00.084
Thursday.

20
00:01:00.784 --> 00:01:03.109
Thursday means the day after Wednesday.

21
00:01:03.409 --> 00:01:05.327
We go swimming on Thursday.

22
00:01:06.027 --> 00:01:08.703
Your turn. Say: Thursday.

23
00:01:11.403 --> 00:01:12.311
Thursday.

24
00:01:13.317 --> 00:01:14.144
Friday.

25
00:01:14.844 --> 00:01:17.540
Friday means the last school day of the week.

26
00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:19.236
I love Friday!

27
00:01:19.936 --> 00:01:23.250
Your turn. Say: Friday.

28
00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:26.742
Friday.

29
00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:28.670
Weekend.

30
00:01:29.370 --> 00:01:33.239
Weekend means Saturday and Sunday, when there is no school.

31
00:01:33.539 --> 00:01:35.898
I visit my grandma at the weekend.

32
00:01:36.598 --> 00:01:39.146
Your turn. Say: Weekend.

33
00:01:41.846 --> 00:01:42.754
Weekend.

34
00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:44.484
Today.

35
00:01:45.184 --> 00:01:46.603
Today means this day.

36
00:01:46.903 --> 00:01:48.113
Today is Monday.

37
00:01:48.813 --> 00:01:52.046
Your turn. Say: Today.

38
00:01:54.746 --> 00:01:55.422
Today.

39
00:01:56.417 --> 00:01:57.371
Tomorrow.

40
00:01:58.071 --> 00:02:00.930
Tomorrow means the day after today.

41
00:02:01.230 --> 00:02:02.719
Tomorrow is Tuesday.

42
00:02:03.419 --> 00:02:06.117
Your turn. Say: Tomorrow.

43
00:02:08.817 --> 00:02:09.737
Tomorrow.

44
00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:12.842
Now let's listen to a conversation.

45
00:02:13.142 --> 00:02:15.014
Rithy, what day is it today?

46
00:02:16.317 --> 00:02:18.072
Today is Thursday.

47
00:02:19.383 --> 00:02:21.046
What do you do on Thursday?

48
00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:24.129
I go swimming on Thursday.

49
00:02:25.417 --> 00:02:27.265
And what is your favorite day?

50
00:02:28.550 --> 00:02:30.819
Friday! Tomorrow is the weekend!

51
00:02:32.117 --> 00:02:35.126
Grammar focus: On plus day of the week.

52
00:02:35.426 --> 00:02:38.787
I have art class on Monday. I play football on Friday.

53
00:02:39.087 --> 00:02:43.980
Use 'on' with days, but 'at the weekend'. Days always start with a capital letter.

54
00:02:44.983 --> 00:02:47.345
Now read and listen. My Week.

55
00:02:47.645 --> 00:02:49.540
There are seven days in a week.

56
00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:53.105
I go to school from Monday to Friday.

57
00:02:54.417 --> 00:02:58.889
On Wednesday, I have art, and on Friday, I play football.

58
00:03:00.183 --> 00:03:03.890
Saturday and Sunday are the weekend, when I rest and play.

59
00:03:05.183 --> 00:03:08.379
Today is Thursday, so tomorrow is Friday!

60
00:03:09.683 --> 00:03:12.463
Quiz time! Choose the correct answer.

61
00:03:12.763 --> 00:03:14.589
I play football blank Friday.

62
00:03:14.889 --> 00:03:17.602
A, in. B, on. C, at.

63
00:03:21.617 --> 00:03:23.570
The answer is B: on.

64
00:03:25.083 --> 00:03:26.978
The day after Monday is blank.

65
00:03:27.278 --> 00:03:31.338
A, Sunday. B, Tuesday. C, Thursday.

66
00:03:35.350 --> 00:03:37.419
The answer is B: Tuesday.

67
00:03:38.917 --> 00:03:41.311
Saturday and Sunday are the blank.

68
00:03:41.611 --> 00:03:45.380
A, weekend. B, today. C, Monday.

69
00:03:49.383 --> 00:03:51.905
The answer is A: weekend.

70
00:03:53.417 --> 00:03:57.857
Now it's your turn to speak. What is your favorite day of the week, and why?

71
00:04:03.157 --> 00:04:09.420
My favorite day is Saturday because I don't have school. On Saturday, I play with my cousins.

72
00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:11.638
Excellent answer, Rithy!

73
00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:17.206
Great work today! You learned eight new words and on plus day of the week.

74
00:04:17.506 --> 00:04:22.736
Today's value is time management. Plan your day and use your time well.

75
00:04:23.036 --> 00:04:25.561
See you in Unit five. Goodbye!

76
00:04:25.861 --> 00:04:28.397
Thank you, Ms. Sarah! Bye, everyone!

